@administration
title: ADMINISTRATION
new-page: true

= Administration

<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:10px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="text-align:left; padding:5px 5px 5px 15px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
<span style="color: var(--bolshevik-color); font-weight:bold;">Spending</span>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; padding:5px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
[+ agriculture_expend +]
</td>
<tr>
<td style="text-align:left; padding:5px 5px 5px 15px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
<span style="color: var(--bolshevik-color); font-weight:bold;">Efficacy</span>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; padding:5px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
[+ efficacy_agriculture : efficacy +]
</td>
<tr>
<td style="text-align:left; padding:5px 5px 5px 15px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
<span style="color: var(--bolshevik-color); font-weight:bold;">Corruption</span>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; padding:5px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.25);">
[+ agriculture_corruption : corruption +]
</td>
</table>


- @improve_admin
- @hire_staff
- @corruption
- @agriculture_return

@improve_admin
title: Streamline the commissariat
subtitle: Cut waste and inefficiencies, increase labor intensity
choose-if: agriculture_streamline_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: There's nothing more to cut at the moment. 
on-arrival: agriculture_expend -= 0.25; efficacy_agriculture += 0.1 if efficacy_agriculture < 1; agriculture_streamline_timer += 8; 

@hire_staff
title: Hire administrative personnel
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources. 
on-arrival: efficacy_agriculture += 0.2 if efficacy_agriculture < 1; agriculture_expend += 0.25; resources -= 0.5;

@corruption
title: Root-out departmental corruption. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: agriculture_corruption_timer = 0 and resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if resources < 0.5 : We lack the resources. ?][?if agriculture_corruption_timer != 0 : We've already initiated an anti-corruption campaign. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; Q.agriculture_corruption_timer = 8;
  Q.efficacy_agriculture = Math.min(1, Q.efficacy_agriculture + 0.1);
  Q.agriculture_corruption = Math.max(0, Q.agriculture_corruption - (0.2 * Q.efficacy_agriculture)); 
!}

@agriculture_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: agriculture

@agriculture_return
title: Cancel action
go-to: agriculture

  

@accelerate_land
title: Accelerate land redistribution to peasants. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources – Increase funding and personnel to the redistribution of confiscated estates. 
choose-if: finalefficacy_agriculture >= 0.6 and resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if efficacy_agriculture < 0.8 : We lack the administrative capacity to accelerate further. ?] [?if resources < 1: We lack the funds to implement this. ?]
max-visits: 2
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1;
  Q.instability += 2; 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 10; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 8; Q.elites_unrest += 5;
  Q.peasants_strength += 10; Q.kulaks_strength += 15; Q.elites_strength -= 2; 
  Q.peasants_b += 5*(1-b_dissent); 
  Q.efficacy_agriculture -= 0.2;
  Q.agriculture_expend += 0.5; 
  Q.food_production *= 0.85;
  Q.food_sold *= 0.9; 
  Q.land_reform_progress += 1; 
  if (Q.coalition_government > 0 && Q.lsr_in_gov) Q.coalition_tension -= 0.5; 
!}

We have intensified the land reform process, by devoting additional resources to confiscation and redistribution of confiscated estates. Peasants celebrate our action, though agricultural production and stability temporarily suffer.

@preserve_estates
title: Issue protections for large productive estates to prevent their disintegration. 
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability -= 2; 
  Q.peasants_unrest += 5;
  Q.kulaks_unrest += 2;
  Q.peasants_b -= 2*(1-b_dissent); 
  Q.food_production *= 1.05;
!}

Protections are established for current large estates, preventing the land from being broken-up and redistributed. Peasants grumble that we are compromising the land reform process, though on the other hand this safeguards part of the food supply.

@establish_communes
title: Establish collective farms, to more effectively pool resources. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; 
  Q.efficacy_agriculture += 0.05; 
  Q.collective_land += 0.05;
  Q.state_land -= 0.05; 
!}

We establish a number of communal farms out of existing estates, to be overseen by peasant committees.

@promote_cooperatives
title: Promote agricultural cooperatives
subtitle: -0.5 resources
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5;
  Q.efficacy_agriculture += 0.05; 
  Q.peasants_strength += 10;
  Q.kulaks_strength += 10;
  Q.cooperative_land += (Q.peasant_land * 0.02); Q.peasant_land *= 0.98; 
!}

We launch a campaign supporting cooperative purchasing, cultivation, and marketing. 


